# SmartFix Repairs Website

A responsive static website developed for SmartFix Repairs, my electronics
diagnostics and repair business.

![SmartFix Repairs website preview](assets/images/site-preview.png)

## Live Website

[Visit the SmartFix Repairs website](YOUR-LIVE-SITE-URL)

## Overview

The website provides:

- Repair-service information
- A description of the customer process
- An online quote-request form
- Contact information
- Mobile-responsive page layouts

## Technologies

- HTML5
- CSS3
- Formspree
- GitHub Pages
- GitHub Actions

## My Work

I designed and implemented the site's structure, responsive styling, business
content, quote-request workflow, and deployment configuration.

